# Lv.50-55 tournament, round 1: Battle -> トーナメント -> L50～55 -> トーナメントにでる -> entry (no cup select). The
# cartridge party (jp_gen1_save.py) has no Pokémon at L50-55, so the game offers rentals (all at L50): all six from rentals (A opens the card, A on はい takes it), the team
# confirm, then the VS scene (バトル-1 title, trainer panels, both teams), the order screen (1P picks B, C-Up, C-Right
# once the COM has finished its own picks), the battle intro up to the command menu, then 1P surrenders (Start,
# はい: no turn is played, so the battle's timing cannot drift) for the results board, かち / まけ and the way back to
# the tournament menu.
@gb green
@rng 1
@window 12 200
1200 START 300 A 400 shot:main_menu
A 200 A 200 shot:battle_mode RIGHT 40 shot:tour_cursor
A 300 shot:tour_select DOWN 40 shot:l50_cursor A 300 shot:l50_menu A 300 shot:entry 100 A 200 shot:rentals_prompt 100 A 150 shot:rental_list
A 120 shot:rental_card 30 A 150 shot:rental_taken A 150 A 150 A 150 A 150 A 150 A 150 A 150 shot:rental_card5 A 150 A 150 shot:rental_card6 A 300 shot:team_confirm
A 60 shot:entry_done 150 shot:stadium_fly 200 shot:screen_flames 130 shot:round_title 160 shot:trainer_panels 120 shot:vs
120 shot:teams 250 shot:order_screen 90 shot:com_confirm 100 shot:com_ready 200
B 60 CU 60 CR 60 shot:p1_confirm 40
A 150 shot:arena_spin 120 shot:ball_throw 160 shot:sendout_flash 90 shot:p1_out 100 shot:com_sendout 90 shot:com_out
150 shot:field 60 shot:command_menu 100
START 40 shot:surrender_prompt 60 RIGHT 40 A 60 shot:white_flash 180 shot:results_board 160 shot:results_hp
60 shot:trainer_panels_after 80 shot:lose_win 140 shot:win_panel 300 shot:tour_menu_return 100
